  "answer_text": "AUTHENTICATION_FAILED in IPsec is usually caused by an authentication/configuration mismatch between peers (often the PSK or related auth payloads). Our guidance emphasizes that the PSK must be identical on both sides and that IKE/auth payloads must match for the tunnel to establish. To investigate, review the IPsec site connection history for any auth-payload mismatch messages and ensure your IPsec settings are identical on both peers (PSK, IKE phase 1/2, etc.).",
